{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_11211260","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1121126001:1":{"text":"General, we've gathered new intel after talking to the witnesses.","source_cn":"将军，我们又走访调查了一圈，发现了些新情报。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE89517DBB3675A7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121126002:1":{"text":"You came at the perfect time. The statue of Dura has been found.","source_cn":"你们来得正好，女神像找到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58ADF5E28C37FDC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121126003:1":{"text":"What? It's been found? Where?","source_cn":"什么，找到了？在哪里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD31DF2B26D799F75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121126004:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">It's at the Sun Temple.</style> These two esteemed temple members just arrived to bring us the news.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>就在日神殿</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B1DAD92AAAD1450","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121126005:1":{"text":"The statue has been found, however... May I trouble you two by briefing them on the situation at the Sun Temple once more?","source_cn":"不过，虽然找到了，唉……麻烦两位再介绍一